        {"type": "text", "duration": 110, "text": {"zh_cn": "把雷达或声呐装进舰装核心强化槽，变身后进行被动探测。设备占槽并计入负重。", "en_us": "Install radar or sonar in a core enhancement slot. It detects passively while transformed, using a slot and adding weight."}, "point": [2.5, 2.5, 2.5], "placeNearTarget": true, "attachKeyFrame": true},
