        {"type": "text", "duration": 110, "text": {"zh_cn": "探测高亮不等于火控锁定。对准目标使用火控选择键（默认鼠标中键）建立锁定。", "en_us": "A detection highlight is not a fire-control lock. Aim at the target and use fire-control select (middle mouse by default) to lock it."}, "point": [3.5, 2.5, 2.5], "placeNearTarget": true, "attachKeyFrame": true},
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 120},
        {"type": "create_item_entity", "item": "piranport:standard_fire_control_radar", "pos": [2.5, 2.5, 1.5]},
